abstract: >-
  Pure-C++17/20, gfx906 HIP, and Tenstorrent Blackhole P150A TT-Metalium heterogeneous
  inference engine and FP64 RAREBAL-LDLQ WHT128-HLUT4 (4.125 bpw) weight quantization suite
  for baidu/ERNIE-5.5-Flash-Preview (300B = 43L backbone + 3L MoE DSpark+SA, 1,048,576 context)
  on the 7-accelerator SB-M5-P2-192G workstation (AMD EPYC 7542 host with 512 GiB 8-channel
  3200 MT/s ECC DDR4 under D18F0x110=0x0000003B hashed interleave, 68.07 GB/s ALL-5 H2D and
  64.06 GB/s D2H; 5x AMD Radeon Instinct MI50 128 GiB HBM2 + 2x Tenstorrent Blackhole P150A
  64 GiB GDDR6 with kBatchSlots=256 + 253.7 MiB on-die Tensix L1 SRAM over 4x 800G FABRIC_1D;
  0 B CPU DDR4 expert spill, 100% lossless BF16 1M HCA+MLA KV cache, adaptive kTileK=32,768
  FlashIndexer, persistent 1,024-slot 46.16 GiB /dev/shm Tier-1 DDR4 .kvblk arena at 5.50M and
  5.26M tok/s live hot-swap restore, cooled 5-card minimax cost_w, 17-term M-fused HCA split-K,
  zero-VRAM 8/6-gram DSpark+SA, 344/344 zero-scratch gfx906 kernels, and 49/49 Gate-0 suites).
